    "summary": "For an **ASTRA MILITARUM INFANTRY** model. Whenever an **INFANTRY** or **MOUNTED** enemy unit finishes a **Normal move**, **Advance move**, **Charge move** or **Fall Back move** 8\" or closer to the bearer's unit, you roll one D6.\n\nA 4+ stuns that enemy unit until your next turn starts: each attack its models make gets -1 to the **Hit roll**.",
